    "chunk_text": "nes win\u00f0 ongean \u00fea Avaritia stupefacta fatescit Her seo gytsung wundrede hyre geteorodnesse. Largitas avaritiam ligat Her seo rumgyfolnes \u00fea gytsunge wra\u00f0. Largitas avaritiam genibus et calcibus perfodit Her seo rumgyfolnes \u00fea gytsunge mid cneowum and Largitas spolia avaritiae pauperibus dat Her seo rumgyfolnes reaf \u00fe\u00e6re gytsunge \u00feearfum d\u00e6lde. Largitas cum gaudio turbas alloquitur Seo rumgyfolnes mid gefean to \u00feam folce sp\u00e6c. Pax venit, et fugiunt metus et labor et vis Her seo gesibsumnes com, and fleah se ege and \u00fe\u00e6t geswinc Tubae silent, gladii reconduntur in vaginas Her \u00fea byman swigedon and \u00fea sweord on hiora scea\u00f0um Virtutum legio gaudet victo certamine Her \u00fea m\u00e6gnu \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6wf\u00e6stnesse blissia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s gewunnenan Concordia iubet reducere vexilla in castris Her seo ge\u00few\u00e6rnes het beran \u00fea gu\u00f0fanan in on \u00f0a ceastre. Turba psallentium equitum ac pedestrium \u00feis is \u00fe\u00e6t hleo\u00f0rigende folc ridende and eac fotum gangende. Virtutes urbem ingrediuntur Her \u00fea m\u00e6gnu in on \u00fea burh ganga\u00f0. Discordia occultae vulnerat concordiam Her seo unge\u00f0w\u00e6rnes dygollice wundode \u00fea ge\u00f0w\u00e6rnesse. Discordia virtutibus insidiatur et capitur Her seo unge\u00f0w\u00e6rnes \u00fea m\u00e6gnu syrwde and geh\u00e6fte. Fides virtutum turmas alloquitur Her se geleafa \u00feara m\u00e6gna wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t werod spec\u00f0. Fides et caritas mentiuntur locum, ubi templum domini aedificetur Se gele",
